{"spell_id":"spl_01M2SPSHFQPB7PXCZ6WWDAF431","entry_id":"ent_01M2SPSHFQ9727AWY4ENQMP09X","name_zh":"梟之睿智","name_en":"Owl’s Wisdom","alphabet":"O","source_access":{"kind":"basic","sources":[],"explicit_sources":[],"inferred_sources":[],"raw_source_labels":[],"default_character_creation":true},"levels":[{"class":"巡林客","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"德魯伊","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"牧師","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"聖武士","level":2,"note":""},{"class":"術士/法師","level":2,"note":""}],"level_text_raw":"牧師 2，德魯伊 2，聖武士 2，巡林客 2，術士/法師 2","level_source_annotations":[],"school":"變化系","subschool":"","descriptors":[],"components":"言語，姿勢，材料/法器","casting_time":"1 個標準動作","range":"接觸","target":"接觸到的一個生物","area":"","effect":"","duration":"1 分鐘/施法者每等級","saving_throw":"意志，通過則無效（無害）","spell_resistance":"可","additional_costs":"","description_zh":"受術者變得更睿智。此法術給予受術者的感知+4 的增強加值，從而會給感知有關的技\n能帶來通常的好處。牧師，德魯伊，聖武士和巡林客（以及其他以感知為施法的關鍵屬性的施\n法者）接受梟之睿智後並不會因為感知的增加而獲得額外法術，但他們法術的 DC 會因為感\n知的增加而提升。\n奧術施法材料：一些貓頭鷹的羽毛，或一小撮貓頭鷹的糞便。","description_en":null,"source_pages":[784,784],"parse_confidence":1.0,"review":{"spell_status":"unreviewed","entry_status":"unreviewed","flags":[],"issues":[]},"provenance":{"source_key":"c5b63cc46dda714e1d00107221f155a2477acd095902c873a72abe5a6dfec657","heading":"梟之睿智（Owl’s Wisdom ）","translation_status":"not_required","translation_method":null}}
